  "name": "Native Attitude",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "Comment",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -90,
      "params": {
        "text": "Native attitude (spec/systems/natives.md @0x048B62), rebuilt. The colonial-presence alarm bands into the 5 @ATTITUDE levels (Content/Uneasy/Restless/Angry/War); War (alarm>=128, modeled tension>=80) declares war. The band name is read live from the @ATTITUDE table."
      }
    },
